  "method": "Meta-Model based Genetic Algorithm (MMGA)",
  "components": [
    "Experimental macroscopic data (voltage, temperature, capacity)",
    "Multi-parameter search space defined by Latin Hypercube Sampling (LHS)",
    "Artificial Neural Network (ANN) meta-model",
